{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are coming to destroy the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the invading enemies and protect the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SRUSH&quot; is a roguelike pull-action game that delivers precise strategy and exhilarating thrills with simple mouse controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull and fire slimes to collide with enemies and attack them, defending against enemies approaching the nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If enemies reach the nest, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all Waves by defending the nest to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports mouse controls only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Pull Controls!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use only the mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull the slime with your mouse and release to fire it at enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies appear at Wave start and approach the nest each turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all enemies before they reach the nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/ff6456db162435bbf8c511b634e1adbe.poster.avif?t=1758762003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/ff6456db162435bbf8c511b634e1adbe.webm?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/ff6456db162435bbf8c511b634e1adbe.mp4?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen Your Slimes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between Waves, boost stats or acquire skills to power up your slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/2e6fa1991639350070582d55ec7141b4.poster.avif?t=1758762003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/2e6fa1991639350070582d55ec7141b4.webm?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/2e6fa1991639350070582d55ec7141b4.mp4?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhilarating Builds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine slime enhancements and skills to create powerful builds and sweep away enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/e06588d31f7cf5420a93a10b20ab89f0.poster.avif?t=1758762003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/e06588d31f7cf5420a93a10b20ab89f0.webm?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/e06588d31f7cf5420a93a10b20ab89f0.mp4?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Replayability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike system where stats and skills reset after each play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random skills and enemies mean a different experience every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, unlock new skills and characters for fresh discoveries with each session!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 6 character types and 5 difficulty levels, there's plenty of content to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Limitations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the initial character is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can challenge up to Level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills are locked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data cannot be carried over to the full version.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045260?t=1758762003","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045260?t=1758762003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/d7f6e66c57b18afdd8c44f80fc6fcdb9df155327/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758762003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/d7f6e66c57b18afdd8c44f80fc6fcdb9df155327/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758762003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are coming to destroy the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the invading enemies and protect the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SRUSH&quot; is a roguelike pull-action game that delivers precise strategy and exhilarating thrills with simple mouse controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull and fire slimes to collide with enemies and attack them, defending against enemies approaching the nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If enemies reach the nest, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all Waves by defending the nest to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game supports mouse controls only.</p><p class=\"bb_parag