werful builds and sweep away enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/e06588d31f7cf5420a93a10b20ab89f0.poster.avif?t=1758762003\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/e06588d31f7cf5420a93a10b20ab89f0.webm?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/extras/e06588d31f7cf5420a93a10b20ab89f0.mp4?t=1758762003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Replayability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike system where stats and skills reset after each play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random skills and enemies mean a different experience every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, unlock new skills and characters for fresh discoveries with each session!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 6 character types and 5 difficulty levels, there's plenty of content to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Limitations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the initial character is available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can challenge up to Level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills are locked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save data cannot be carried over to the full version.</p>","developers":["AU CREATE"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3808630","name":"SRUSH"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045260/b209d65e24e30d588e0917f63c1c9c13a8bd7389/header.jpg?t=1758762003","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257201353,"mp4":{"480":"ht